---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Uses"
  description="Hardware, editor, stack. The actual setup."
  lede="The actual setup. Anything not on this list got tried and dropped."
  ogImage="uses"
>
  <section class="prose">
    <h2>Hardware</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>MacBook Air M5 (laptop).</li>
      <li>Custom-built PC (desktop).</li>
      <li>Nuphy Halo65 mechanical keyboard.</li>
      <li>Logitech MX Master mouse.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Editor + terminal</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Neovim</strong> in <strong>WezTerm</strong> for everything that matters.</li>
      <li><strong>Claude Code</strong> for AI pairing &mdash; with the
        <a href="https://github.com/danielmiessler/claude-caveman">caveman skill</a> for output
        compression and the <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/roady">roady MCP server</a>
        for plan-of-record.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Stack</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Go</strong> for services and CLIs (most of <a href={`${BASE}lab`}>/lab</a>).</li>
      <li><strong>Astro</strong> for static sites (this one).</li>
      <li><strong>Vue</strong> where interactive UI earns the framework.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Workflow</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/roady">Roady</a></strong> &mdash; every
        project I touch has a plan-of-record that survives context resets.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/klarlabs-studio/mnemos">Mnemos</a></strong> &mdash;
        long-term memory the assistant reads back across sessions.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/tokenops">TokenOps</a></strong> &mdash;
        local daemon tracking Claude Max / ChatGPT / Copilot / Cursor plan windows; warns before
        the cap and detects compressed output styles (e.g. caveman).</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/klarlabs-studio/fortify">Fortify</a></strong> &mdash;
        wraps every outbound LLM call in my Go services. Timeout + circuit breaker + cost budget +
        stream timeout by default.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://nox-hq.dev">Nox</a></strong> &mdash; runs on every PR. AI-aware
        SAST: prompt injection, embedding leakage, agent over-privilege, MCP hardening, AIBOM.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="muted">
      <em>Format inspired by <a href="https://uses.tech">uses.tech</a>.</em>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
